   "cover": "2026-10-26-1930-reel-cover.jpg",
   "caption": "Which meal tastes like a place to you?\n\nMaybe it’s something you ate once, somewhere you’d never been before. Maybe it’s toast at your nan’s kitchen table. Food carries places, and the people we shared it with, better than almost anything.\n\nTell us yours in the comments: the dish, then the place. We’ll share a few on Sunday.\n\nA new question every Monday.",
