   "cover": "2026-10-28-1930-reel-cover.jpg",
   "caption": "Dime con quién andas y te diré quién eres. Inglés: Tell me who you spend time with, and I’ll tell you who you are.\n\nIt’s the Spanish cousin of “birds of a feather”. Half warning, half compliment, depending on who’s saying it.\n\nTry it with a smile this week, when a friend starts sounding just like their flatmate: “Dime con quién andas y te diré quién eres.”\n\nWho has shaped the way you talk? Tell us below.",
