   "media": "2026-11-02-1930-post.jpg",
   "caption": "Who made you feel at home somewhere new?\n\nA neighbour who knocked with a plate of food. A colleague who explained the rules nobody writes down. A stranger who waited patiently while you found the words.\n\nThey probably don’t know how much it mattered. Tell us about them in the comments, and if you can, tell them too.\n\nA new question every Monday.",
