   "cover": "2026-11-06-1930-reel-cover.jpg",
   "caption": "Una pregunta puede durar toda la cena. Inglés: One question can last a whole dinner.\n\nDime Más Intermediate (B1–B2) is 60 cards of real questions in Spanish, with English on every card. Draw one, ask it, and let the conversation go wherever it goes.\n\nTonight’s card: “Si pudieras cambiar de trabajo mañana, ¿qué harías y por qué?” If you could change jobs tomorrow, what would you do and why?\n\nOn Amazon UK, link in bio.",
