   "caption": "What’s a word from another language you wish everyone had?\n\nSome languages have one word for a feeling that takes a whole sentence anywhere else. Some have a word for a time of day, a kind of weather, or the friend you’d ring at 2am.\n\nTell us the word, where it’s from and what it means. We’ll share a few on Sunday.\n\nA new question every Monday.",
