   "cover": "2026-11-11-1930-reel-cover.jpg",
   "caption": "A mal tiempo, buena cara. Inglés: Put a brave face on bad weather.\n\nVery handy in a British November. It works for actual rain and for everything else: a cancelled train, a long week, a conversation that didn’t go to plan.\n\nTry it the next time a friend’s having a rough day: “Venga, a mal tiempo, buena cara.” Come on, chin up.\n\nWhat gets you through a grey week? Tell us below.",
